@startuml templates-files
salt
{
{T
 + <b>product repository | <b>what it is
 ++ .cumin-trace.toml | settings: product prefix, areas, label of requirement issues
 ++ docs/ja/requirements/ | requirement documents
 +++ index.md | entry page and the list of areas
 +++ overview.md | problem, goal, metrics, people, out of scope, phases
 +++ technology.md | technologies and why they were chosen
 +++ glossary.md | terms
 +++ <area>/ | one directory for each area
 ++++ index.md | overview with diagrams, requirements, open questions
 ++++ *.puml, *.svg | diagrams of the area
 +++ backlog.md | what is put off, with the reason and the trigger
 ++ scripts/render-diagrams.sh | renders .puml to .svg
 ++ .github/workflows/ | check of the format on pull requests
 ++ .claude/skills/ | skill for writing requirements with an agent
 ++ site/ | Starlight site
}
}
@enduml
